WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:10.800
10/21/15.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.160
The day I've been waiting for.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.340
The day we've all been waiting for.

00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:20.500
The day that the future would finally arrive.

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:24.120
As foretold by the great prophet, Robert Zemeckis.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:26.780
Today is the day.

00:00:27.620 --> 00:00:30.420
That the Cubs will finally win the World--

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.600
and strike three called!

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:39.920
They haven't been to the World Series since 2000, but the Mets...

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.300
Greetings.

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:52.580
Thank you for watching 10.21.15.

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:54.340
I guess...

00:00:55.200 --> 00:00:58.720
Be sure to leave what you did for Back To The Future Day

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:01.420
in the comments...

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:05.180
Hopefully yours was... better than mine...

00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:13.140
Be sure to subscribe for new horrors.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:18.640
...but probably not as horrific as... this...

00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:25.080
And look our for my new short film next week.

